{"id":"n38146-1-9","stage":1,"title":"귀걸이 · 耳环","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38146-1-9-1","ko":"너는 평소에 귀걸이는 잘 안 하고 다니는구나.","zh":"你平时好像不太戴耳环啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"평소에","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평소에","audio":"/audio/4692238712d63baef961.mp3"}},{"text":"귀걸이는","meaning":"耳环，耳坠","explanation":"귀걸이：耳环，耳坠；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"귀걸이","audio":"/audio/afa6416084bce48ce5cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38146","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀걸이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"귀걸이는","audio":"/audio/c30bc5f13cd7acb4d4d7.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"经常","explanation":"잘：经常","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"9","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备","explanation":"하다：佩戴，穿衣打扮，置办，置备；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"5","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Kore